[{"id":"qada-10-47-6","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"presuđeno je","en":"it was judged"},{"bs":"izvršite!","en":"(you all) carry out!"},{"bs":"presuđuju","en":"they judge"},{"bs":"da odredi","en":"so that he/it may decree"}],"ref":"10:47","answerWord":"قُضِىَ","answerSound":"audio/833edda98f434c8bf70f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And for every nation there is a messenger. And when their messenger cometh (on the Day of Judgment) it will be judged between them fairly, and they will not be wronged.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَلِكُلِّ","أُمَّةٍ","رَّسُولٌ","فَإِذَا","جَآءَ","رَسُولُهُمْ","قُضِىَ","بَيْنَهُم","بِٱلْقِسْطِ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُظْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-2-117-4","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it decreed"},{"bs":"određuje se","en":"it is decreed"},{"bs":"ispunio sam","en":"I fulfilled"},{"bs":"neka ubije","en":"let him kill"}],"ref":"2:117","answerWord":"قَضَىٰٓ","answerSound":"audio/26f15297e62667fa8b55.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The Originator of the heavens and the earth! When He decreeth a thing, He saith unto it only: Be! and it is.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["بَدِيعُ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَإِذَا","قَضَىٰٓ","أَمْرًا","فَإِنَّمَا","يَقُولُ","لَهُۥ","كُن","فَيَكُونُ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-2-210-11","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"i određeno je","en":"and it was decreed"},{"bs":"presudio si","en":"you judged"},{"bs":"završena je","en":"it was finished"},{"bs":"pa ih je dovršio","en":"so he/it completed them"}],"ref":"2:210","answerWord":"وَقُضِىَ","answerSound":"audio/46040dcbdd358be47aff.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Wait they for naught else than that Allah should come unto them in the shadows of the clouds with the angels? Then the case would be already judged. All cases go back to Allah (for judgment).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["هَلْ","يَنظُرُونَ","إِلَّآ","أَن","يَأْتِيَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","فِى","ظُلَلٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلْغَمَامِ","وَٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","وَقُضِىَ","ٱلْأَمْرُ","وَإِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","تُرْجَعُ","ٱلْأُمُورُ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-10-93-16","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"presuđuje","en":"he/it judges"},{"bs":"pa odredi!","en":"so decree!"},{"bs":"ispunio je","en":"he/it fulfilled"},{"bs":"pa ih je dovršio","en":"so he/it completed them"}],"ref":"10:93","answerWord":"يَقْضِى","answerSound":"audio/9a5cea9e4c06430128c6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We verily did allot unto the Children of Israel a fixed abode, and did provide them with good things; and they differed not until the knowledge came unto them. Lo! thy Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that wherein they used to differ.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","بَوَّأْنَا","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","مُبَوَّأَ","صِدْقٍ","وَرَزَقْنَٰهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلطَّيِّبَٰتِ","فَمَا","ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","حَتَّىٰ","جَآءَهُمُ","ٱلْعِلْمُ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","يَقْضِى","بَيْنَهُمْ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","فِيمَا","كَانُوا۟","فِيهِ","يَخْتَلِفُونَ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-28-29-1","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"ispunio je","en":"he/it fulfilled"},{"bs":"neka ubije","en":"let him kill"},{"bs":"ispunio ju je","en":"he/it fulfilled it"},{"bs":"da se ispuni","en":"so that it may be fulfilled"}],"ref":"28:29","answerWord":"قَضَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/9b049370e61478103356.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, when Moses had fulfilled the term, and was travelling with his housefolk, he saw in the distance a fire and said unto his housefolk: Bide ye (here). Lo! I see in the distance a fire; peradventure I shall bring you tidings thence, or a brand from the fire that ye may warm yourselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","قَضَىٰ","مُوسَى","ٱلْأَجَلَ","وَسَارَ","بِأَهْلِهِۦٓ","ءَانَسَ","مِن","جَانِبِ","ٱلطُّورِ","نَارًا","قَالَ","لِأَهْلِهِ","ٱمْكُثُوٓا۟","إِنِّىٓ","ءَانَسْتُ","نَارًا","لَّعَلِّىٓ","ءَاتِيكُم","مِّنْهَا","بِخَبَرٍ","أَوْ","جَذْوَةٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلنَّارِ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَصْطَلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-15-66-0","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"i obznanili smo (odluku)","en":"and We decreed"},{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it decreed"},{"bs":"pa odredi!","en":"so decree!"},{"bs":"završava se","en":"it is finished"}],"ref":"15:66","answerWord":"وَقَضَيْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/9fe18ff13e74156d7ff7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We made plain the case to him, that the root of them (who did wrong) was to be cut at early morn.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَقَضَيْنَآ","إِلَيْهِ","ذَٰلِكَ","ٱلْأَمْرَ","أَنَّ","دَابِرَ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","مَقْطُوعٌ","مُّصْبِحِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-2-200-1","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"završili ste","en":"you (all) finished"},{"bs":"određuje se","en":"it is decreed"},{"bs":"da završe","en":"so that they may finish"},{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"}],"ref":"2:200","answerWord":"قَضَيْتُم","answerSound":"audio/d82acc806dd29a78f3ce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when ye have completed your devotions, then remember Allah as ye remember your fathers or with a more lively remembrance. But of mankind is he who saith: \"Our Lord! Give unto us in the world,\" and he hath no portion in the Hereafter.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["فَإِذَا","قَضَيْتُم","مَّنَٰسِكَكُمْ","فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","كَذِكْرِكُمْ","ءَابَآءَكُمْ","أَوْ","أَشَدَّ","ذِكْرًا","فَمِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَن","يَقُولُ","رَبَّنَآ","ءَاتِنَا","فِى","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَمَا","لَهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","مِنْ","خَلَٰقٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-4-65-16","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"presudio si","en":"you judged"},{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"},{"bs":"da se ispuni","en":"so that it may be fulfilled"},{"bs":"i određeno je","en":"and it was decreed"}],"ref":"4:65","answerWord":"قَضَيْتَ","answerSound":"audio/c60c6b63822b78747676.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But nay, by thy Lord, they will not believe (in truth) until they make thee judge of what is in dispute between them and find within themselves no dislike of that which thou decidest, and submit with full submission.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["فَلَا","وَرَبِّكَ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","حَتَّىٰ","يُحَكِّمُوكَ","فِيمَا","شَجَرَ","بَيْنَهُمْ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يَجِدُوا۟","فِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","حَرَجًا","مِّمَّا","قَضَيْتَ","وَيُسَلِّمُوا۟","تَسْلِيمًا"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-4-103-1","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"završili ste","en":"you (all) finished"},{"bs":"ispunio je","en":"he/it fulfilled"},{"bs":"da završe","en":"so that they may finish"},{"bs":"presuđuje","en":"he/it judges"}],"ref":"4:103","answerWord":"قَضَيْتُمُ","answerSound":"audio/d03f6c332b5bcb149749.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When ye have performed the act of worship, remember Allah, standing, sitting and reclining. And when ye are in safety, observe proper worship. Worship at fixed times hath been enjoined on the believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["فَإِذَا","قَضَيْتُمُ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","قِيَٰمًا","وَقُعُودًا","وَعَلَىٰ","جُنُوبِكُمْ","فَإِذَا","ٱطْمَأْنَنتُمْ","فَأَقِيمُوا۟","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","إِنَّ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","كَانَتْ","عَلَى","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","كِتَٰبًا","مَّوْقُوتًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-6-60-11","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"da se ispuni","en":"so that it may be fulfilled"},{"bs":"izvršite!","en":"(you all) carry out!"},{"bs":"završili ste","en":"you (all) finished"},{"bs":"završena je","en":"it was finished"}],"ref":"6:60","answerWord":"لِيُقْضَىٰٓ","answerSound":"audio/dc49bf7d27dd1266a27d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He it is Who gathereth you at night and knoweth that which ye commit by day. Then He raiseth you again to life therein, that the term appointed (for you) may be accomplished. And afterward unto Him is your return. Then He will proclaim unto you what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم","بِٱلَّيْلِ","وَيَعْلَمُ","مَا","جَرَحْتُم","بِٱلنَّهَارِ","ثُمَّ","يَبْعَثُكُمْ","فِيهِ","لِيُقْضَىٰٓ","أَجَلٌ","مُّسَمًّى","ثُمَّ","إِلَيْهِ","مَرْجِعُكُمْ","ثُمَّ","يُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-8-44-10","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"da odredi","en":"so that he/it may decree"},{"bs":"presuđuju","en":"they judge"},{"bs":"pa odredi!","en":"so decree!"},{"bs":"ispunio ju je","en":"he/it fulfilled it"}],"ref":"8:44","answerWord":"لِيَقْضِىَ","answerSound":"audio/e43c44d1e572079e556b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when He made you (Muslims), when ye met (them), see them with your eyes as few, and lessened you in their eyes, (it was) that Allah might conclude a thing that must be done. Unto Allah all things are brought back.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","يُرِيكُمُوهُمْ","إِذِ","ٱلْتَقَيْتُمْ","فِىٓ","أَعْيُنِكُمْ","قَلِيلًا","وَيُقَلِّلُكُمْ","فِىٓ","أَعْيُنِهِمْ","لِيَقْضِىَ","ٱللَّهُ","أَمْرًا","كَانَ","مَفْعُولًا","وَإِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","تُرْجَعُ","ٱلْأُمُورُ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-12-68-19","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"ispunio ju je","en":"he/it fulfilled it"},{"bs":"da se ispuni","en":"so that it may be fulfilled"},{"bs":"da završe","en":"so that they may finish"},{"bs":"ispunili su","en":"they fulfilled"}],"ref":"12:68","answerWord":"قَضَىٰهَا","answerSound":"audio/026d0c7e01437aa758c4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they entered in the manner which their father had enjoined, it would have naught availed them as against Allah; it was but a need of Jacob's soul which he thus satisfied; and lo! he was a lord of knowledge because We had taught him; but most of mankind know not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","دَخَلُوا۟","مِنْ","حَيْثُ","أَمَرَهُمْ","أَبُوهُم","مَّا","كَانَ","يُغْنِى","عَنْهُم","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","مِن","شَىْءٍ","إِلَّا","حَاجَةً","فِى","نَفْسِ","يَعْقُوبَ","قَضَىٰهَا","وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَذُو","عِلْمٍ","لِّمَا","عَلَّمْنَٰهُ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","أَكْثَرَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-17-23-0","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"i odredio je","en":"and he/it decreed"},{"bs":"neka ubije","en":"let him kill"},{"bs":"ispunio sam","en":"I fulfilled"},{"bs":"završili ste","en":"you (all) finished"}],"ref":"17:23","answerWord":"وَقَضَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/16a24132632aab864c2a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thy Lord hath decreed, that ye worship none save Him, and (that ye show) kindness to parents. If one of them or both of them attain old age with thee, say not \"Fie\" unto them nor repulse them, but speak unto them a gracious word.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَقَضَىٰ","رَبُّكَ","أَلَّا","تَعْبُدُوٓا۟","إِلَّآ","إِيَّاهُ","وَبِٱلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ","إِحْسَٰنًا","إِمَّا","يَبْلُغَنَّ","عِندَكَ","ٱلْكِبَرَ","أَحَدُهُمَآ","أَوْ","كِلَاهُمَا","فَلَا","تَقُل","لَّهُمَآ","أُفٍّ","وَلَا","تَنْهَرْهُمَا","وَقُل","لَّهُمَا","قَوْلًا","كَرِيمًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-20-72-10","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa odredi!","en":"so decree!"},{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it decreed"},{"bs":"presuđuju","en":"they judge"},{"bs":"presudio si","en":"you judged"}],"ref":"20:72","answerWord":"فَٱقْضِ","answerSound":"audio/63f5320ba8b958fe58b9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: We choose thee not above the clear proofs that have come unto us, and above Him Who created us. So decree what thou wilt decree. Thou wilt end for us only this life of the world.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","لَن","نُّؤْثِرَكَ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","جَآءَنَا","مِنَ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَٱلَّذِى","فَطَرَنَا","فَٱقْضِ","مَآ","أَنتَ","قَاضٍ","إِنَّمَا","تَقْضِى","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنْيَآ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-20-114-10","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"završava se","en":"it is finished"},{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it decreed"},{"bs":"ispunio ju je","en":"he/it fulfilled it"},{"bs":"pa ih je dovršio","en":"so he/it completed them"}],"ref":"20:114","answerWord":"يُقْضَىٰٓ","answerSound":"audio/ca7ff854e58e1f63420c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then exalted be Allah, the True King! And hasten not (O Muhammad) with the Qur'an ere its revelation hath been perfected unto thee, and say: My Lord! Increase me in knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["فَتَعَٰلَى","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلْمَلِكُ","ٱلْحَقُّ","وَلَا","تَعْجَلْ","بِٱلْقُرْءَانِ","مِن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يُقْضَىٰٓ","إِلَيْكَ","وَحْيُهُۥ","وَقُل","رَّبِّ","زِدْنِى","عِلْمًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-22-29-1","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"da završe","en":"so that they may finish"},{"bs":"i odredio je","en":"and he/it decreed"},{"bs":"pa odredi!","en":"so decree!"},{"bs":"ispunio ju je","en":"he/it fulfilled it"}],"ref":"22:29","answerWord":"لْيَقْضُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a1049a0e921ea1d828c0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then let them make an end of their unkemptness and pay their vows and go around the ancient House.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","لْيَقْضُوا۟","تَفَثَهُمْ","وَلْيُوفُوا۟","نُذُورَهُمْ","وَلْيَطَّوَّفُوا۟","بِٱلْبَيْتِ","ٱلْعَتِيقِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-28-28-6","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"ispunio sam","en":"I fulfilled"},{"bs":"presuđuje","en":"he/it judges"},{"bs":"ispunio je","en":"he/it fulfilled"},{"bs":"izvršite!","en":"(you all) carry out!"}],"ref":"28:28","answerWord":"قَضَيْتُ","answerSound":"audio/3495fd98b62f60490e62.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: That (is settled) between thee and me. Whichever of the two terms I fulfil, there will be no injustice to me, and Allah is Surety over what we say.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["قَالَ","ذَٰلِكَ","بَيْنِى","وَبَيْنَكَ","أَيَّمَا","ٱلْأَجَلَيْنِ","قَضَيْتُ","فَلَا","عُدْوَٰنَ","عَلَىَّ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","نَقُولُ","وَكِيلٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-28-44-5","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"},{"bs":"presuđuju","en":"they judge"},{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it decreed"},{"bs":"da odredi","en":"so that he/it may decree"}],"ref":"28:44","answerWord":"قَضَيْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/2edac4a55761328005ee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And thou (Muhammad) wast not on the western side (of the Mount) when We expounded unto Moses the commandment, and thou wast not among those present;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَمَا","كُنتَ","بِجَانِبِ","ٱلْغَرْبِىِّ","إِذْ","قَضَيْنَآ","إِلَىٰ","مُوسَى","ٱلْأَمْرَ","وَمَا","كُنتَ","مِنَ","ٱلشَّٰهِدِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-33-36-6","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it decreed"},{"bs":"pa ih je dovršio","en":"so he/it completed them"},{"bs":"ispunio sam","en":"I fulfilled"},{"bs":"da odredi","en":"so that he/it may decree"}],"ref":"33:36","answerWord":"قَضَى","answerSound":"audio/760c590e27cf4dede2a1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And it becometh not a believing man or a believing woman, when Allah and His messenger have decided an affair (for them), that they should (after that) claim any say in their affair; and whoso is rebellious to Allah and His messenger, he verily goeth astray in error manifest.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","لِمُؤْمِنٍ","وَلَا","مُؤْمِنَةٍ","إِذَا","قَضَى","ٱللَّهُ","وَرَسُولُهُۥٓ","أَمْرًا","أَن","يَكُونَ","لَهُمُ","ٱلْخِيَرَةُ","مِنْ","أَمْرِهِمْ","وَمَن","يَعْصِ","ٱللَّهَ","وَرَسُولَهُۥ","فَقَدْ","ضَلَّ","ضَلَٰلًا","مُّبِينًا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"qada-34-14-1","words":["verb:qada"],"options":[{"bs":"odredili smo","en":"we decreed"},{"bs":"da odredi","en":"so that he/it may decree"},{"bs":"odredio je","en":"he/it decreed"},{"bs":"ispunio ju je","en":"he/it fulfilled it"}],"ref":"34:14","answerWord":"قَضَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/47b10d8235a1e4a91d63.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We decreed death for him, nothing showed his death to them save a creeping creature of the earth which gnawed away his staff. And when he fell the jinn saw clearly how, if they had known the Unseen, they would not have continued in despised toil.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odrediti, izvršiti","en":"to decree, to carry out"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","قَضَيْنَا","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلْمَوْتَ","مَا","دَلَّهُمْ","عَلَىٰ","مَوْتِهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","دَآبَّةُ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","تَأْكُلُ","مِنسَأَتَهُۥ","فَلَمَّا","خَرَّ","تَبَيَّنَتِ","ٱلْجِنُّ","أَن","لَّوْ","كَانُوا۟","يَعْلَمُونَ","ٱلْغَيْبَ","مَا","لَبِثُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْعَذَابِ","ٱلْمُهِينِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَضَى"}},{"id":"ahalla-4-160-7","words":["verb:ahalla"],"options":[{"bs":"dozvoljeno je","en":"it was permitted"},{"bs":"dozvolili smo","en":"we permitted"},{"bs":"i da dozvolim","en":"and so that I may permit"},{"bs":"i dozvoljava","en":"and he/it permits"}],"ref":"4:160","answerWord":"أُحِلَّتْ","answerSound":"audio/79ec728ae92852660a77.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Because of the wrongdoing of the Jews We forbade them good things which were (before) made lawful unto them, and because of their much hindering from Allah's way,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dozvoliti, učiniti dopuštenim","en":"to permit, to make lawful"},"passage":["فَبِظُلْمٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","هَادُوا۟","حَرَّمْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","طَيِّبَٰتٍ","أُحِلَّتْ","لَهُمْ","وَبِصَدِّهِمْ","عَن","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","كَثِيرًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَلَّ"}},{"id":"ahalla-5-87-7","words":["verb:ahalla"],"options":[{"bs":"dozvolio je","en":"he/it permitted"},{"bs":"i dozvoljava","en":"and he/it permits"},{"bs":"i dozvoljeno je","en":"and it was permitted"},{"bs":"pa dozvoljavaju","en":"so they permit"}],"ref":"5:87","answerWord":"أَحَلَّ","answerSound":"audio/6d4c87e34872f669ff85.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Forbid not the good things which Allah hath made lawful for you, and transgress not, Lo! Allah loveth not transgressors.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dozvoliti, učiniti dopuštenim","en":"to permit, to make lawful"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","لَا","تُحَرِّمُوا۟","طَيِّبَٰتِ","مَآ","أَحَلَّ","ٱللَّهُ","لَكُمْ","وَلَا","تَعْتَدُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَلَّ"}},{"id":"ahalla-3-50-6","words":["verb:ahalla"],"options":[{"bs":"i da dozvolim","en":"and so that I may permit"},{"bs":"dozvolili smo","en":"we permitted"},{"bs":"dozvoljeno je","en":"it was permitted"},{"bs":"i dozvoljava","en":"and he/it permits"}],"ref":"3:50","answerWord":"وَلِأُحِلَّ","answerSound":"audio/b741d2536ccdc4d3d468.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (I come) confirming that which was before me of the Torah, and to make lawful some of that which was forbidden unto you. I come unto you with a sign from your Lord, so keep your duty to Allah and obey me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dozvoliti, učiniti dopuštenim","en":"to permit, to make lawful"},"passage":["وَمُصَدِّقًا","لِّمَا","بَيْنَ","يَدَىَّ","مِنَ","ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ","وَلِأُحِلَّ","لَكُم","بَعْضَ","ٱلَّذِى","حُرِّمَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","وَجِئْتُكُم","بِـَٔايَةٍ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","فَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُونِ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَلَّ"}},{"id":"ahalla-14-28-8","words":["verb:ahalla"],"options":[{"bs":"i nastanili su","en":"and they settled"},{"bs":"i dozvoljeno je","en":"and it was permitted"},{"bs":"dozvolio je","en":"he/it permitted"},{"bs":"skrnavite","en":"you (all) profane"}],"ref":"14:28","answerWord":"وَأَحَلُّوا۟","answerSound":"audio/94fe585f60c27670d2ee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hast thou not seen those who gave the grace of Allah in exchange for thanklessness and led their people down to the Abode of Loss,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dozvoliti, učiniti dopuštenim","en":"to permit, to make lawful"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","تَرَ","إِلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","بَدَّلُوا۟","نِعْمَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","كُفْرًا","وَأَحَلُّوا۟","قَوْمَهُمْ","دَارَ","ٱلْبَوَارِ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَلَّ"}},{"id":"ahalla-22-30-10","words":["verb:ahalla"],"options":[{"bs":"i dozvoljeno je","en":"and it was permitted"},{"bs":"i da dozvolim","en":"and so that I may permit"},{"bs":"i dozvoljava","en":"and he/it permits"},{"bs":"pa dozvoljavaju","en":"so they permit"}],"ref":"22:30","answerWord":"وَأُحِلَّتْ","answerSound":"audio/76e5b31622dce83993c3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That (is the command). And whoso magnifieth the sacred things of Allah, it will be well for him in the sight of his Lord. The cattle are lawful unto you save that which hath been told you. So shun the filth of idols, and shun lying speech,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dozvoliti, učiniti dopuštenim","en":"to permit, to make lawful"},"passage":["ذَٰلِكَ","وَمَن","يُعَظِّمْ","حُرُمَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَهُوَ","خَيْرٌ","لَّهُۥ","عِندَ","رَبِّهِۦ","وَأُحِلَّتْ","لَكُمُ","ٱلْأَنْعَٰمُ","إِلَّا","مَا","يُتْلَىٰ","عَلَيْكُمْ","فَٱجْتَنِبُوا۟","ٱلرِّجْسَ","مِنَ","ٱلْأَوْثَٰنِ","وَٱجْتَنِبُوا۟","قَوْلَ","ٱلزُّورِ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَلَّ"}},{"id":"ahalla-35-35-1","words":["verb:ahalla"],"options":[{"bs":"nastanio nas je","en":"he/it settled us"},{"bs":"dozvolili smo","en":"we permitted"},{"bs":"dozvolio je","en":"he/it permitted"},{"bs":"i dozvoljava","en":"and he/it permits"}],"ref":"35:35","answerWord":"أَحَلَّنَا","answerSound":"audio/7db5d676ed968a60d4b3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who, of His grace, hath installed us in the mansion of eternity, where toil toucheth us not nor can weariness affect us.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dozvoliti, učiniti dopuštenim","en":"to permit, to make lawful"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَحَلَّنَا","دَارَ","ٱلْمُقَامَةِ","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦ","لَا","يَمَسُّنَا","فِيهَا","نَصَبٌ","وَلَا","يَمَسُّنَا","فِيهَا","لُغُوبٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَحَلَّ"}}]